%select{ name: name, id: name, class: select_classes, disabled: disabled }
  - if include_blank
    %option{ value: "" } Select...
  - options.each do |label, value|
    %option{ value: value, selected: selected.to_s == value.to_s }= label
- if show_search_hint?
  %p.text-xs.mt-1{ class: theme.muted_text }
    Showing first #{options_limit} options. Use search for more results.
